  "approval": "Carl approved A–E, G–J and L, excluding K, then selected East A and North B. On 13 September 2026 he selected Almond Branches (Characters A) to replace D for 3m and requested deployment. Night Cafe (Characters B) for 2m and Cypress Fields (Characters C) for 4m are also approved for deployment. The user also approved the green Garden Rhythm B for 2s and selected green Triple Shoots A to overwrite C for 3s. The user also approved greener Moonlit Four C for 4s. On 29 September 2026 Carl selected Seven with Irises C for 7s and requested deployment. L replaced F as the earlier white dragon; both remain studies after the later Almond Blossom C selection. D remains a study. Carl selected the raft concept for 8s and approved deployment of the resulting eight-bamboo painting without recolouring. Carl approved Copper Sunset for 5s with four green stalks and a reddish-brown central stalk, replacing the earlier all-green concept. Carl approved the corrected all-green B still life with six bamboo stalks to replace Green Rhythm J for 6s; its complete composition and colours are preserved. Carl selected the first nine-bamboo option, Moonlit Bamboo Wind Chime, and explicitly approved deployment; the nine hanging tubes and complete painted composition are preserved. Carl approved B, Three Cafe Lanterns, for 3 disks and explicitly requested deployment. The complete selected middle-panel crop is preserved without repainting or recolouring in a documented quality-90 WebP game export. Carl selected C — The Potter’s Table to replace Nine Stars I for 9p and explicitly requested deployment. The nine patterned plates were deployed and the old face archived. The intervening Nine Stars restoration was a misunderstanding. Carl explicitly clarified that The Potter’s Table C must replace Nine Stars as 9 disks. The approved Potter SVG is restored byte-for-byte; Nine Stars remains archived. The eight-star adaptation is not deployed and 8 disks is unchanged. Carl selected the first option, The Red Vineyard, for 5 characters (5m / 五萬) and explicitly approved GitHub deployment. The complete approved composition and colours are preserved; the wheat and iris alternatives are not used. Carl approved the latest red 六萬 calligraphy with lemons, cypresses, lake and village as 6 characters (6m). The complete approved canvas and colours are retained; the sunflower study is not selected. Carl selected the last seven-characters option with blue iris flowers and golden 萬, Irises at Dusk C, and explicitly requested GitHub deployment as 7m / 七萬. The complete composition and proportions are preserved without repainting; the olive and wheat alternatives are not used. Carl selected A, Four Oranges, the left panel with four whole oranges on blue cloth, for 4 disks (4p / Pin4) and explicitly requested GitHub deployment. The complete approved crop is retained without repainting or recolouring; the bowl and orange-slice alternatives are not used. Carl approved the generated Starry Olive Grove painting as 8 characters (8m / 八萬) and explicitly requested GitHub deployment. The complete olive-branch composition, colours and proportions are preserved; the older seven-characters olive study is not used. Carl selected B, The Provençal Kitchen, the middle painting with six ceramic plates in two columns of three, as 6 disks (6p / Pin6) and explicitly requested GitHub deployment. The full selected crop is fitted to the shared tile format without regeneration, repainting or recolouring; the sunflower and fishing-float alternatives are not used. Carl approved the final corrected standalone Seven Apples painting for 7 disks (7p / Pin7), with four apples in the bowl and three on the cloth. Its 900 x 1200 crop is exactly 3:4 and uniformly downsampled; all seven apples remain visible without stretching, repainting or recolouring. Earlier wrong-count attempts are not used. Carl chose the middle poppy-field option for 9 characters, requested a smaller characters sign to fit organically, and explicitly requested GitHub deployment of the resulting revised image. The earlier larger-Wan version, wheat and harbour alternatives are not selected. Carl approved the standalone Lemons by the Sea painting with exactly eight lemons arranged 3-2-3 for 8 disks and explicitly requested GitHub deployment. The complete 3:4 composition is proportionally downsampled without repainting or recolouring; Seven Apples 7p and The Potter’s Table 9p are unchanged. Carl explicitly selected C, Green Dragon at the Vineyard, from the first green-dragon board for 6z / Hatsu and requested deployment. Preserve its green dragon, blue sky and golden vineyard without recolouring. The later mountain, vase, cypress and iris alternatives are not selected. The exact 450 x 600 crop is uniformly reduced to 300 x 400, with no stretching. Carl selected C, The Red Sail, for 1 characters (1m / 一萬) and explicitly requested GitHub deployment. Its small hull lettering and complete 3:4 boat painting are preserved without stretching, cropping, repainting or recolouring. The sower and open-window alternatives are not selected. This completes the characters suit. Carl selected A — The Billowing Courtyard for South wind (2z / Nan) and explicitly requested GitHub deployment. The linen courtyard painting is used, not B the boat or C the gate. Its original board and lossless A crop remain in the approval archive; the documented game export uses the existing proportions helper. Carl selected the winter middle panel B as the replacement North wind and explicitly requested deployment. Snowbound North replaces Wind Ribbons; the former source and exact playable images remain archived. The winter scene is cropped to 3:4 without stretching or repainting. Carl approved the latest standalone lighthouse painting stormy_sunset_lighthouse_seascape.png for West wind (3z / Shaa), with cloud-shaped 西. Its complete 1086 x 1448 composition is uniformly downsampled, without cropping, stretching, repainting or recolouring during deployment. This completes all 34 Van Gogh identities. Carl then selected C, The Almond-Blossom Dragon, from the three White Dragon alternatives and explicitly requested GitHub deployment. It replaces Quiet Dragon L for 5z / Haku. The entire approved 1086 x 1448 painting is uniformly downsampled to 300 x 400 with zero stretch and zero extra bleed. The former L playable PNG and SVG remain archived.",
